  "sourceTitle": "Chicken Drummettes",
  "sourceText": "Chicken Drummettes\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, November 30, 2009 - 11:48pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup lite soy sauce\n1 teaspoon sugar\n3 cloves garlic, pressed\n1 teaspoon cayenne pepper\n2 pounds chicken drummettes, wash\ncut off excess skin\n1/2 cup butter\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Dip chicken in butter and coat with crushed corn flake crumbs. Place on an ungreased cookie sheet and bake at 350 degrees in a preheated oven for 45 minutes to 1 hour.",
